	(text "Interfaces: pin 1 is the first signal in each requested module order.\nU2 module pinout assumed: 1 GND, 2 OUT, 3 IN. Verify before assembly.\nUse 3.3 V logic modules and FTDI UART; GPIO2 must be HIGH during boot.\nJ1 and J5 share +5V: use only one 5 V source at a time (no isolation).\nTo program: hold SW1, cycle power, then release. C2: pad 1 positive; ESR 0.3-22 ohm."
